    "id": "M21",
    "title_zh": "知识与生活：相连的哲学候选",
    "title_en": "Knowing and living: connected philosophical proposal",
    "claim_zh": "生成中的认识经内容、实际根据、相关错误和可修订标准形成；G0 与公开 J1–J4/E 连接其生活意义。已接通选择性修订、来源依存学习及模型族修订：由失败构造候选，保留旧记录，检验分歧与共同遗漏，在获得支持的范围内恢复信赖。",
    "claim_en": "Knowing forms through content, actual grounds, relevant error and revisable standards; G0 and explicit J1–J4/E connect its place in living. The chain now connects selective revision, learned source dependencies and model-family revision: construct candidates from failure, retain the history, test disagreements and shared omissions, and renew reliance within supported conditions.",
    "scope_zh": "模型修订前沿按论证方法与有限实现完成：新增30项 Lean 定理／72项声明审计、76次修订运行。穷尽有限输入且测量忠实时，接受可确立预测对应，无须先假定实际规律已在候选语法中。保留测量、因果定位、稳定范围与推展条件，及既有26／53、16／32与四项统计量复核的原范围。无新人／动物实验或独立验收；普遍语义、意识及整套理论必要性仍开放。",
    "scope_en": "Model-revision frontier completed as a defended method and finite realization: 30 new Lean theorems/72 declaration audits and 76 revision runs. Faithful exhaustive finite-input checking establishes accepted predictions without prior membership of the actual law in the grammar. Measurement, causal location, stable scope and transfer remain explicit, as do the prior 26/53, 16/32 and four-statistic results. No new human/animal experiment or independent acceptance. Universal semantics, consciousness and whole-theory necessity remain open.",
